WEBVTT

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:32.185
And we must strive
to do all of this in a decade.

00:04:33.296 --> 00:04:35.056
If we achieve these goals,

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:37.936
by 2030 our lives won't be worse,

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:41.586
and we won't have to
sacrifice everything we enjoy.

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:44.316
Instead, the way we live
will be healthier,

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:48.283
cleaner, smarter and better for all of us.

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:52.171
The global response
to the COVID-19 pandemic

00:04:52.195 --> 00:04:55.746
and the funds flowing
into the economic recovery

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:58.136
demonstrate how much can be achieved

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:01.246
when those in positions
of power come together